title: '"contentward-reachable mentioners" folder'
pid: 4fe443c1-ed3b-43ce-95e7-22b9ac2c5ede
body: |2-
  If node D is in origin O's recursive content,
  and mentioner R mentions D,
  then O might file R somewhere in its own recursive content.
  Once it does, its mentionward views
  should collect D and any similar node
  into a "contentward-reachable mentioners" folder.
